    language_code: 'fr',
    translated_text: 'Use expand to include additional information about transitions in the response. This parameter accepts transitions.fields, which returns information about the fields in the transition screen for each transition. Fields hidden from the screen are not returned. Use this information to populate the fields and update fields in Transition issue.',
